  <item>
    <title>EP04 我在美国学汽修 | 留学生Michelle与她的爱车故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663b3b4ddf37950503a429ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663b3b4ddf37950503a429ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 May 2024 08:43:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一位独自来到大洋彼岸求学的女生，为何对一辆老奔驰一见钟情，甘愿为它报名汽修学院？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的故事属于Michelle和她的爱车。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有多爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>她说，是早晨开出车库时的上扬的嘴角，是晚上到家下车之前的恋恋不舍，是车坏了时6个月的不离不弃。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听罢，你讶异，说这像极了爱情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，无论你是否喜欢汽车，都欢迎加入我们的聊天。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次不聊速度与激情，只有对座驾最长情的告白。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1 Michelle和她的爱车故事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 汽修学校的老师同学：只有Gangster才会开这辆车（奔驰 W126）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 汽车小讲堂：这辆车竟然有电动座椅调节！奔驰为什么要把座椅调节放在车门上？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 终于开着爱车去了Joshua Tree! （封面图来源）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 提车第一周，引擎就坏了，一修就是六个月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 一头雾水的修车初体验：不太懂车的留子遇上英文不太好的修车师傅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 买车五千八，最后却砸进去两万，从不觉得后悔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 报了汽修学校，发现换机油换刹车片也没有那么难</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> 因为汽车的缘分，结识了人生导师Sean Lee</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> Michelle的复古情结：老歌、二手衣服与胶片摄影</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2 车友闲聊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a> 怎么定义一台好车？Dream Car是哪一款？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a> 新能源成为大趋势的今天，是否考虑买一辆电车？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 受到偶像Michèle Mouton的影响，报名了拉力赛训练营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a> Michelle：如果电影《飞驰人生》有第三部的话，我希望主角是女孩儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a> 给女孩的专属买车建议：不要怕麻烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> “只要你不放弃你的车，你的车也不会放弃你的，不像爱情。”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>陈光荣 《Intro AE 86》</span></p><span></span><p><span>陶喆 《沙滩》</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈光荣 《Gloves 2 Ali》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们的小红书：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Michelle: </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5abd8aa711be107f03c913f8" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5abd8aa711be107f03c913f8"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Atlas: </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ccc45fb000000001002f263" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ccc45fb000000001002f263"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Jean: </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ad019d64eacab39b10d57a3" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ad019d64eacab39b10d57a3"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><em><span>还没听够？欢迎通过节目主页联系方式加入我们的听友群，成为熊猫青年FM的精神股东！</span></em></p>]]></description>
